{"title":"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> denote the value of the sum\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/6/966581f30cd08db78e0a3aa1c8ef3a972b9ad1cf.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{n=0}^{668} (-1)^{n} {2004 \\choose 3n}\\]\" width=\"132\" height=\"53\" />\nDetermine the remainder obtained when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> is divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/e/6ee927e1332358c96c62c277441c907c4f51057f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Consider the polynomial <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/2/3722ab43b126eeea4ee7047e44f1b846b165d916.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(x)=(x-1)^{2004}=\\sum_{n=0}^{2004}\\binom{2004}{n}\\cdot(-1)^n x^{2004-n}.\\]\" width=\"380\" height=\"53\" />\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/a/41aeae6bf45033b950738601e8cca3d3290ecfcf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega^3=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/9/6b9bede9d773d0d4e2197e69c3dc411ab41b7806.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega\\neq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"17\" />. We have \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/6/88615e9e9f8dd3d093f6e863309236baa4282592.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\frac{f(1)+f(\\omega)+f(\\omega^2)}{3} &amp;= \\frac{(1-1)^{2004}+(\\omega-1)^{2004}+(\\omega^2-1)^{2004}}{3} \\\\ &amp;= \\frac{1}{3}\\sum_{n=0}^{2004}\\binom{2004}{n}\\cdot(-1)^n\\cdot(1^{2004-n}+\\omega^{2004-n}+(\\omega^2)^{2004-n}) \\\\ &amp;= \\sum_{n=0}^{668}(-1)^n \\binom{2004}{3n}. \\end{align*}\" width=\"618\" height=\"159\" />\n</p><p>where the last step follows because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/b/53b202b234fc1390178d582865c5699180b9fe56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1^k+\\omega^k+\\omega^{2k}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"107\" height=\"17\" /> is 0 when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> is not divisible by 3, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> is divisible by 3.\n</p><p>We now compute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/f/1dfe3b52695313fa09de018be318f279263b6e8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{(1-1)^{2004}+(\\omega-1)^{2004}+(\\omega^2-1)^{2004}}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"305\" height=\"39\" />. WLOG, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/e/e3e233b138b23840357dfe654ba230e8f9ca2d85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega = \\frac{-1+\\sqrt{3}i}{2}, \\omega^2=\\frac{-1-\\sqrt{3}i}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"246\" height=\"41\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/f/96f065b76cf3982dc04d97e05a4818348ad72cfa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega-1=\\frac{-3+\\sqrt{3}i}{2} = \\sqrt{3}\\cdot \\frac{-\\sqrt{3}+i}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"278\" height=\"41\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/b/3dbccfc253ebb5194c4598e817e574fc4fa7470c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega^2-1=\\sqrt{3}\\cdot\\frac{-\\sqrt{3}-i}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"181\" height=\"41\" />. These numbers are both of the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/0/45006edd83c9318e702277a9a554ccd8f85e2b11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{3}\\cdot\\varphi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"49\" height=\"20\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/1/921aade3100afbc11d0d13f71cdd7e68d83ad52e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\varphi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" /> is a 12th root of unity, so both of these, when raised to the 2004-th power, become <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/f/08f40d1132cf5a385982953c16367e64786c8668.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{1002}$\" width=\"34\" height=\"15\" />. Thus, our desired sum becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/e/8cee18f337f5398e5b175417f3f8639245cada7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\cdot3^{1001}$\" width=\"56\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>To find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/4/774c33a2dcf0ba70d04e2431eedbc750d0fdf41f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\cdot3^{1001} \\pmod{1000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"156\" height=\"19\" />, we notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/5/c45e792c4e08c306363daa93a81ee20914928441.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{\\phi{500}}\\equiv 3^{200}\\equiv 1 \\pmod{500}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"213\" height=\"20\" /> so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/b/cfbde965033810bccaa78ba401505761d7c8cd25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{1001}\\equiv 3 \\pmod{500}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"158\" height=\"19\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f53344a9ac96ec07421909c423bbed665fa4cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\cdot3^{1001}=2(500k+3)=1000k+6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"276\" height=\"19\" />. Thus, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/c/d2c35c0dbbf60f6ec60a1411fc17f90e38050aa7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{006}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005\">Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems\">Problems</a></b>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?t=14769\">Source</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017071225\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.023 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.039 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 195/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1426/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 184/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5047/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.190      1 Template:Mock_AIME_box\n100.00%    7.190      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:8529:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017071225 and revision id 70960. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}